# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# witnessrecord.app was the original domain; the app and site were renamed
# Witness Camera in September 2026 and witnesscamera.com is now canonical.
# This sends every witnessrecord.app URL to its exact equivalent on the new
# domain, path preserved, so nothing already linked or indexed breaks.
#
# For this rule to fire at all, witnessrecord.app must stay attached as a
# custom domain on this same Cloudflare Pages project (Pages dashboard ->
# this project -> Custom domains -> add domain). Once witnesscamera.com is
# added the same way, both serve identically until this rule takes effect;
# nothing here removes or reconfigures the existing witnessrecord.app
# attachment on its own.
https://witnessrecord.app/*  https://witnesscamera.com/:splat  301
